jab sar pe laga gurz to abbas pukaare<br>
<br>
aye baad e saba jaake ye aqa ko batade <br>
rehwaar se girta hoo'n maishaano'n ko katake<br>
<br>
bebas hoo'n bohat haath nahi hai mere tan par <br>
hai tapti zameen aur hoo'n mai zeen ke upar <br>
hai kaun jo goudi me mujhe leke utaare<br>
<br>
mashkeeze pe jab jab bhi huwi teero'n ki bochhaar <br>
abbas ye hasrat se sada dete the har baar <br>
teero'n se koi mashke sakina ko bachaale<br>
<br>
haathon ke bina zeen pa sambhla nahi jaata <br>
maqtal me mujhe kuch bhi dikhayi nahi deta <br>
hai teer meri aankh me ab koun nikaale<br>
<br>
saqqa e haram kehta tha ye sukhi zaba'n se <br>
kya faayeda jeene ka agar pyaase hai bacche <br>
ab ye hi duwa hai ke khuda mujhko uthale<br>
<br>
zakhmo'n se badan choor hai tukdo'n me bata sar <br>
bazu bhi nahi tan pa mai girta hu zamee'n par <br>
dete hain sada behte huwe khoon ke dhare<br>
<br>
tanhaayi ka mujhko hai sakina ka bohat gham <br>
ye bojh nahi hoga mere dil se kabhi kam <br>
bacchi meri khaayegi sitamgar ke tamache<br>
<br>
pyaasi wo rahi jis ka mujhe kehte hain saqqa <br>
ye dard bhi seene me mere saath rehega <br>
khoo'n rote hain ghurbat pa meri chaand sitaare<br>
<br>
ye zainabe muztar se koi kehde to jaakar <br>
khaime me nahi aayega ab saaniye hyder <br>
hai itrate at'haar shahedee'n ke hawale<br>
<br>
ab chain se soyenge kaha'n aale payambar <br>
har waqt yateemao'n ko satayenge sitamgar <br>
sona hai mujhe aaj se dariya ke kanaare<br>
<br>
saqqa e haram ne jo padha nouha ye aksar <br>
mehsoos huwa karbobala me mujhe akber <br>
jaise koi saqqa kahe dariya ke kanaare<br>
